{"id":205,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Calibri\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.5000pt;} span.10{ font-family:Calibri;} span.15{ font-family:Calibri; font-size:9.0000pt;} span.16{ font-family:Calibri; font-size:9.0000pt;} span.17{ font-family:Calibri; font-size:9.0000pt;} p.MsoAcetate{ mso-style-name:批注框文本; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:9.0000pt;} p.MsoHeader{ mso-style-name:页眉; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; border-bottom:1.0000pt solid #000; mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid #000; padding:0pt 0pt 1pt 0pt ; tab-stops:center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt ; vsb_temp-mode:char; mso-pagination:none; text-align:center; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:9.0000pt;} p.MsoFooter{ mso-style-name:页脚; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; tab-stops:center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt ; vsb_temp-mode:char; mso-pagination:none; text-align:left; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:9.0000pt;} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:36.0000pt; mso-footer-margin:36.0000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style>由校团委、图书馆、材料科学与工程学院主办，中北大学耕砚书画社协办的“笔耕忆昔，书以继志”主题书画展于2025年12月10日在图书馆二层展厅拉开帷幕。校党委宣传部部长刘彬、校团委书记魏翀，材料学院党委书记廖海洪，校团委副书记王彩萍，材料学院党委副书记辛振东等嘉宾应邀参加开幕式。</p><div><p>本次书画展以“笔耕忆昔，书以继志”为主题，深度融合红色革命精神与传统书画艺术精髓。展厅内，一幅幅书法作品笔力苍劲、气韵生动；绘画与篆刻作品则细腻传情、意蕴深远。红色主题创作承载着革命先辈的壮志豪情，传统艺术形式延续着中华文脉的深厚底蕴，青年学子的爱国热忱与艺术创作的沉厚底蕴在此交融共生，构筑起一场兼具思想深度与艺术美感的文化盛宴。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XU4r/fL8rVMlWkUKmNiLlWfL8-8L8UOaolLPU8LbMzTVUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybokybLkyZMlrVLm7ZL8W2UzLbL4T2LlVkM7laolVfM8QFnmGiLmVRn7rFMl-DLzvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaoR9Jqdxnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6989085EE2183BFA3939F1AB4E09AA7F/F0521CDE/5B617\" vheight=\"368\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Xol-/YL8M7nzQfoKzr7L7CsL7r7MRTOkUmCPL47PLR7anl-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRUYyZLYh7M8l4o77YL8LZLNlYnm7bMzVfnNW7M4rfLNVFMRTVnzC8LNMFLz-ZUmrRgjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPLmLsg47sLR9ZgtA8pUxcc&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17088&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>活动现场，嘉宾一行驻足品鉴参展作品，高度赞扬师生的艺术功底与创作情怀，充分肯定我院长期深耕校园文化、举办特色艺术活动的做法。院党委书记廖海洪表示，此次书画展搭建了青春与历史对话的平台，既展现了中北学子的艺术成果，也传递出青年对艺术追求与文化传承的思考和担当。材料学院始终坚持“五育并举”，重视学生全面发展，通过此类文化活动，引导学生在艺术熏陶中厚植家国情怀、涵养文化自信，成长为兼具专业素养与人文底蕴的时代新人。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XLRl/snmAkUlC4UK4TfnNUZUmWkoR7OZn7CPoRnknmA7L470gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysLky8Lkh7LzMkMNWVnlVfoRLiLl-sU8r7LNr2UlC8M8MFnm-aL4lbnmfFMz9sM4CJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaoR9Jqdxnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/67040D13B6BEEAA8351B7CED2EFAF47C/F20359F0/58776\" vheight=\"369\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XUz6/RUmCsMRGPUKmNYL4CDnN7soz-ODU46kU4-anznfM8U0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8LYyYMYyDLm7bnl7Pn7lPMNl4U8-4Ll7DUzLPLNlPU8MFnNCbozUDMlMFLzn2UzW7gjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPLmLsg47sLR9ZgtA8pUxcc&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17088&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>活动尾声，嘉宾们积极参与“笔耕忆昔，书以继志”互动环节，亲笔写下对考研学子的殷切寄语与美好祝福，并将祈福签挂于祈福树上，字里行间饱含着对广大学子的深厚期许。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Xozl/iUmLaM8-4LKzvPUN-4o77YL4AOVoRVkMl7YnR6fnm-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRnSh2U1y4UNWkLRn7nzLinzlYLR-bM4T2nRUDM4TRoznFLzQRLmNPM46FMlC8LmCJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaoR9Jqdxnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ECEFB3BBB04DE35E5202979FD4679C94/16C29177/5F426\" vheight=\"369\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XLRV/fozTkMzGsMKzNbL8UYLRUbMmfOVMzCbUNliMRG8Lml0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiLSh2LSysn77sU47Zo7UPoRNZMRGYLzQkoz9PU87iUlVFo7C4nlQVMmnFLzQ7MRWkgjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPLmLsg47sLR9ZgtA8pUxcc&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17088&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>本次书画展为期一个月，欢迎广大师生前往中北大学图书馆二层展厅，于墨香雅韵中开启艺术与精神的双重之旅，共赴革命精神与文化传承的时代和鸣。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XU4r/fL8rVMlWkUKmNiLlWfL8-8L8UOaolLPU8LbMzTVUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybokybLkyZMlrVLm7ZL8W2UzLbL4T2LlVkM7laolVfM8QFnmGiLmVRn7rFMl-DLzvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaoR9Jqdxnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17088&e=.png"}